<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <!-- Tests for package V-BRIDGE2 in docs/specs/port-backlog.md (Open Dental 25.4 program links): the Trophy (Enhanced) Command line and
       its tags, the Clever One by VATECH hand-off and program row, and the Clerri launch (dashboard address, Client Key per clinic, Family module
       button). Sample command lines and patients are synthetic; nothing is launched and no vendor is called. Database tests use a scratch MariaDB
       database with a unique per-run name, dropped afterwards. Every .cs file under this folder is compiled. -->
